[7039.238638, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[7039.269019, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mfor\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m host \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36min\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m hosts[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"hosts\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m]:\r\u001b[12d"]
[7039.269878, "o", "net_connect = Netmiko(host = host[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"name\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m],\r\u001b[13d"]
[7039.270482, "o", "username = host[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"username\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m],\r\u001b[14d"]
[7039.271036, "o", "password = host[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"password\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m],\r\u001b[15d"]
[7039.271641, "o", "port = host[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"port\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m],\r\u001b[16d"]
[7039.272228, "o", "device_type = host[\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"type\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m])\r\u001b[17d"]
[7039.272808, "o", "print(f\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"Logged into {host['name']} successfully\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m)\r\u001b[18d"]
[7039.273396, "o", "output = net_connect.send_config_set(loopback_config.split(\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"\\n\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m))\r\u001b[19d"]
[7039.273955, "o", "print(f\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"Pushed config into {host['name']} successfully\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m)\r\u001b[20d"]
[7039.274517, "o", "net_connect.disconnect()\r\u001b[21d"]
[7039.275075, "o", "print(\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[32m\"Done!\"\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m)\r\u001b[22d"]
[7039.275661, "o", "The Python file \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mis\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m first reading \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36min\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the host information \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mfrom\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the hosts.yml file. The interface information\r\u001b[23d"]
[7039.276274, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mis\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m then read \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mfrom\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the YAML file(interfaces.yml). The host \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mand\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m interface information are now\r\u001b[24d"]
[7039.276867, "o", "available \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mas\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m Python dictionaries.\r\u001b[25d"]
[7039.277439, "o", "Next, we use the Jinja2 library to render the template \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mwith\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the variables. The result of this \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mis\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m that\r\u001b[26d"]
[7039.277989, "o", "loopback_config contains the completed (absolute) file \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mwith\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m all loopback information.\r\u001b[27d"]
[7039.278547, "o", "Next, we simply loop over the devices (hosts) \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mand\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mfor\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m each host we create an SSH connection via Netmiko.\r\u001b[28d"]
[7039.279083, "o", "Finally, we use the send_config_set method to which we \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mpass\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the loopback_config information\r\u001b[29d"]
[7039.279627, "o", "(which contains nothing more than the commands to configure a loopback interface).\r\u001b[30d"]
[7039.280183, "o", "Execute the script\r\u001b[31d"]
[7039.280755, "o", "(netmiko-lab)$ python3 set_loopback_template.py\r\u001b[32d"]
[7039.281318, "o", "Logged into 192.168.1.101 successfully\r\u001b[33d"]
[7039.281883, "o", "Pushed config into 192.168.1.101 successfully\r\u001b[34d"]
[7039.282414, "o", "Logged into 192.168.1.102 successfully\r\u001b[35d"]
[7039.283006, "o", "Pushed config into 192.168.1.102 successfully\r\u001b[36d"]
[7039.28352, "o", "Done!\r\u001b[37d"]
[7039.284107, "o", "You can run the script “get_interface_description.py” \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mfrom\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the previous tasks to see \u001b(B\u001b[0;1m\u001b[36mif\u001b[39m\u001b(B\u001b[m the new\r\u001b[38d"]
[7039.284687, "o", "loopback interfaces were added\r\u001b[39d"]
